TORCS tracks pack
=================

This pack holds the 29 TORCS tracks that aren't in the main TORCS download
(which has 9). Together they make all 38 of the tracks in Debian's
free-software TORCS 1.3.7.

To install
----------
1. Find the directory that holds your !TORCS application.
2. Copy the !TORCS directory from this pack into that same directory, for
   example by dragging it from this window onto that directory's window.
   The Filer merges it into your !TORCS and adds the tracks. Nothing in
   your copy is replaced.

Then start TORCS. The new tracks appear in Configure Race, and each race
type (Non-Championship, Endurance, Championship and so on) uses its usual
tracks.

Without the pack, a race type that names a track you don't have runs on
one of the tracks you do have, and says so.

The tracks are big, and some are slower to draw than others. The pack
works with every TORCS 1.3.7 release for RISC OS (1.3.7-riscos2 and
later).

Licences
--------
The tracks are part of TORCS's game data, under the licences listed in
!TORCS.Licences.TORCS-data in the main download.
